  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>Fragrance Family:</b> Warm & Spicy<br><br><b>Scent Type:</b> Warm & Sweet Gourmands<br><br><b>Key Notes:</b> Buttercream, Plum Butter, Ambrox<br><br><b>Fragrance Description:</b> Glossier You Rêve is a lush, sweet gourmand that opens with rich buttercream, followed by an addictive center of plum butter, toasted almond, iris, and creamy white sandalwood—heightened by a warm, musky base driven by ambrox.<br><br><b>About the Bottle:</b> The bottle is an objet d’art in its own right. It is crafted in-house at Glossier; it has the real thumbprint indent of the designer. So just like the scent, the bottle of Glossier You Rêve is unfinished. It needs you to hold it to complete it.<br><br><b>About the Fragrance:</b> Impressions of You are not scents you wear</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Spray scent as desired on your pulse points: your neck, behind your ears, your wrists, and more.<br>-Allow fragrance to settle for a few moments rather than rubbing it in as this can disrupt the scent.<br>-Apply post-shower and after moisturizing to aid absorption for a longer, stronger scent impact.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol Denat., Fragrance/Parfum, Water/Aqua/Eau, Benzyl Salicylate, Farnesol, Linalool, Coumarin.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>Fragrance Family:</b> Warm & Spicy<br><br><b>Scent Type:</b> Warm & Sweet Gourmands<br><br><b>Key Notes:</b> Buttercream, Plum Butter, Ambrox<br><br><b>Fragrance Description:</b> Glossier You Rêve is a lush, sweet gourmand that opens with rich buttercream, followed by an addictive center of plum butter, toasted almond, iris, and creamy white sandalwood—heightened by a warm, musky base driven by ambrox.<br><br><b>About the Bottle:</b> The bottle is an objet d’art in its own right. It is crafted in-house at Glossier; it has the real thumbprint indent of the designer. So just like the scent, the bottle of Glossier You Rêve is unfinished. It needs you to hold it to complete it.<br><br><b>About the Fragrance:</b> Impressions of You are not scents you wear</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Spray scent as desired on your pulse points: your neck, behind your ears, your wrists, and more.<br>-Allow fragrance to settle for a few moments rather than rubbing it in as this can disrupt the scent.<br>-Apply post-shower and after moisturizing to aid absorption for a longer, stronger scent impact.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol Denat., Fragrance/Parfum, Water/Aqua/Eau, Benzyl Salicylate, Farnesol, Linalool, Coumarin.</div></details>",
